Here's _my_ way to make NetHack harder:

* Two words: stronger monsters. Currently the only creatures capable of
busting a character at midgame time are jabberwocks and minotaurs. Tut,
tut. If the "Hell-only" monsters' attacks contained several d10's or
d20's, we'd solve half of the problem right there.

* Make it so that intrinsic resistances are less powerful than
extrinsic resistances. Like, they only halve the damage instead of
negating it entirely. I actually have a patch that does this, but I
haven't released it yet.

* Remove the ability to unrestrict weapon skills. It severely breaks
roleplaying and character differentiation. Also, your god should only
give you a weapon artifact if you can already reach "skilled" in its
weapon skill.



